"""semsearchd: local semantic search for the Semantic search Omarchy plugin.

Indexes documents (as passages), source code (as function-sized blocks) and
images, embeds them with EmbeddingGemma 2 through a llama-server it starts on
demand, and answers JSON-lines requests on a unix socket. Ranking is by cosine
similarity (the meaning, or what a picture shows), optionally fused with
SQLite FTS5 (the literal words, in the text or the file path).
"""

